<main class="container">
        
        <!-- BANNER HÌNH ẢNH THEO IDENTITY NATIONAL GEOGRAPHIC -->
        <section class="fig-image-wrapper">
            <img src="/Source/Animals2/sunda-gharial/sunda-gharial.jpg" alt="Sunda Gharial Swamp Expedition">
            
            <div class="hero-text-overlay">
                <div class="header-title">The Prehistoric Survivor</div>
                <h2 class="header-subtitle">Sunda Gharial (Tomistoma schlegelii)</h2>
                <div class="iucn-badge-inline">
                    <span class="iucn-tag">IUCN Status:</span>
                    <span class="iucn-status-value">Endangered</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-split">
            
            <!-- Khối bên trái: Carousel (Nội dung đã được cô đọng & bổ sung phần Nguy cơ) -->
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <div id="carouselTrack">
                    
                    <!-- Slide 1: About -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide active">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            Tracing their history back over <span style="color: var(--iucn-endangered); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">200 million years</span>, these mysterious freshwater crocodilians rely exceptionally on <span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">learning rather than instinct</span> to survive.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Native to the remote lowland swamps and rainforest rivers of Southeast Asia, they are highly advanced and successful predators. Though they resemble crocodiles, they are defined by a distinctive long, narrow snout housing around 80 needle-like teeth—perfectly adapted for catching fish, frogs, monkeys, and even deer.</p>
                            <p>Possessing the longest skull of any crocodilian species, they are incredibly shy and secretive, preferring slow-moving waters with abundant vegetation to hide in the shadows. Unusually for crocodilians, there is absolutely no evidence to suggest that Sunda gharial parents provide any care for their young after they hatch.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 2: Threats -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            An ancient lineage fading from the rainforest shadows. They are now restricted entirely to Borneo and Sumatra due to <span style="color: var(--iucn-endangered); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">severe habitat loss</span> and aggressive <span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">hunting and poaching</span>.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">The pristine lowland swamp forests and peat swamps they naturally inhabit are under immense pressure from destructive human interventions and collection. As these vital, slow-moving waterways are continuously degraded and cleared, their ability to hide and hunt is rapidly diminishing.</p>
                            <p>Compounding the severe, localized threats of illegal poaching, this endangered and highly specialized species is also increasingly vulnerable to the unpredictable and devastating impacts of global climate change and severe weather events.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 3: Tickets & Membership -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic" style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                            Support & Experience the Wildlife Firsthand
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; text-align: left;">
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/sunda-gharial/gharial-ticket.jpg" alt="Sunda Gharial Ticket">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Visit your favourite animals</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">Book your visit today and see all the amazing animals at the zoo!</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Book Now</a>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/sunda-gharial/gharial-membership.jpg" alt="Sunda Gharial Member">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Become a member and don't miss a thing</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">See these magnificent animals any day you like with free unlimited entry for a year, plus up to 10% off future experiences.</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Become a Member</a>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="carousel-controls">
                    <button id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous Slide">←</button>
                    <span class="slide-indicator" id="slideIndicator">1 / 3</span>
                    <button id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next Slide">→</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Khối bên phải: Fact Grid (Sử dụng mẫu mã SVG bò sát chuẩn) -->
            <div class="fact-grid">
                
                <!-- Species Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path d="M2 14h12l4-3h4v3l-3 2H2v-2z" />
                            <path d="M14 11V9c0-1.5-1-2-2.5-2S9 8.5 9 10" />
                            <path d="M4 14v-2l2 2v-2l2 2" />
                            <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="0.5" />
                        </svg>
                        Species
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Reptile </div> 
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Freshwater crocodilian</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Life Span Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 2h14M5 22h14M7 2l5 8 5-8M7 22l5-8 5 8"/></svg>
                        Life Span
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Up to 80 years</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Habitat Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12,2 3,17 21,17"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="22"/></svg>
                        Habitat
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Lowland & peat swamps</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Region Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="22" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
                        Region
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Southeast Asia </div> 
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Restricted to Borneo & Sumatra</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Diet Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 2v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3 3 3 0 0 0 3-3V2"/><line x1="6" y1="11" x2="6" y2="22"/><line x1="3" y1="2" x2="3" y2="6"/><line x1="9" y1="2" x2="9" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="2" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="21" y1="2" x2="21" y2="22"/><path d="M17 2v8a4 4 0 0 0 4 4"/></svg>
                        Diet
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Carnivore </div> 
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Fish, monkeys, frogs & deer</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Avg Size Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="8" width="22" height="8" rx="1"/><line x1="5" y1="8" x2="5" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="9" y2="14"/><line x1="13" y1="8" x2="13" y2="12"/><line x1="17" y1="8" x2="17" y2="14"/></svg>
                        Avg Size
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Up to 5m </div> 
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Longest crocodilian skull</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Behaviour & Zoo Location Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                        Behaviour & Zoo Location
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value" style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3;">
                        Shy & secretive<br>
                        <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block;">Located in the Monsoon Forest</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Khối tư liệu phim bên dưới -->
    <section class="doc-band">
        <div class="dashed-border-top"></div>
        <div class="doc-container">
            <div class="doc-text">
                <h3> The Prehistoric Phantom </h3>
                <p> Discover the unique biology and tragic decline of one of the world's most secretive and specialized needle-toothed crocodilians. </p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/jlXjfgCZEok?si=viPd91tJ13sHSxsO" target="_blank" class="doc-btn">
                <span class="play-icon">▶</span> Watch Film
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="dashed-border-bottom"></div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
            const totalSlides = slides.length;
            const indicator = document.getElementById('slideIndicator');
            let currentSlide = 0;

            function updateSlide(index) {
                slides.forEach(slide => slide.classList.remove('active'));
                slides[index].classList.add('active');
                indicator.textContent = `0${index + 1} / 0${totalSlides}`;
            }

            document.getElementById('nextBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            document.getElementById('prevBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + totalSlides) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            updateSlide(currentSlide);
        });
    </script>


